  "descripcion": "The Gran Canaria Hotel is opening and soon guests will be flying in from all over the globe to visit your subtropical island hotel in Hotel Architect - Poolside Paradise. Relaxation relies on careful planning, creative logistics, and a seasoned hotel manager. Do you have what it takes?",
